            <title>3.20.2</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 10:38:21 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>211</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.20.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- Your own slash commands, such as a skill, now end the read-only mode a Slack reply puts a session in. Before, they were refused until you sent a plain message
- The prompt-cache keep-alive no longer ends that read-only mode on its own
- A background agent's report, a scheduled prompt or a peer message that quotes a Slack reply no longer puts the session in read-only mode
]]></description>
