        <item>
            <title>3.20.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 21:41:38 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>209</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.20.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- Claude Code extension updates are now cross-checked: Canopy downloads the extension from the VS Marketplace and installs it only if it is byte-identical to the copy published on Open VSX. A mismatch is not installed and you get a notification. This guards against a tampered extension reaching Canopy through one compromised marketplace, as happened on Cursor's marketplace on 2026-10-29.
- New setting in General: "Update the Claude Code extension automatically" (on by default). Turn it off to have the launcher offer each new version with an Install button instead.

### Changes
- When Open VSX has not published a version yet, the update waits and the launcher shows it as available, instead of installing it unchecked.
- Canopy now always runs the extension from its own, cross-checked folder. A copy in `~/.vscode/extensions` is used only when Canopy has none of its own.
]]></description>
